rd-price\">€7.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Toast with Broad Bean Paste</h6><p class=\"mono\">320 g</p></div><p>Milk toast, broad bean &amp; feta paste, broad beans, pickled beets, pistachios</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€6.50</p></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-category\"><div class=\"menu-category-header\"><h3>Foodsharing</h3><p class=\"md\">Plates meant to be passed and savoured together</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Beef Tartare</h6><p class=\"mono\">180 g</p></div><p>Beef tenderloin, onion, pickled cucumber, egg yolk, mustard, bread</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€10.00</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Burrata</h6><p class=\"mono\">250 g</p></div><p>Burrata, grilled zucchini, tomatoes, pistachios, basil pesto, bread</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€8.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Shrimp</h6><p class=\"mono\">200 g</p></div><p>Shrimp, garlic, chili, parsley, olive oil, bread</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€10.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Fish Soup</h6><p class=\"mono\">300 g</p></div><p>Fish broth, cod, salmon, shrimp, vegetables, herbs, bread</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€8.00</p></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-category\"><div class=\"menu-category-header\"><h3>Pizza</h3><p class=\"md\">Wood-fired, hand-stretched, classically inspired</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Margherita</h6><p class=\"mono\">450 g</p></div><p>Tomato sauce, mozzarella, basil</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€6.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Pepperoni</h6><p class=\"mono\">480 g</p></div><p>Tomato sauce, mozzarella, pepperoni, oregano</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€7.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Capricciosa</h6><p class=\"mono\">500 g</p></div><p>Tomato sauce, mozzarella, ham, mushrooms, artichokes, olives</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€8.00</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Prosciutto e Rucola</h6><p class=\"mono\">480 g</p></div><p>Tomato sauce, mozzarella, prosciutto, arugula, parmesan</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€8.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Musa</h6><p class=\"mono\">500 g</p></div><p>Artichoke cream, fior di latte, grilled pepper, guanciale, pecorino romano, basil</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€9.50</p></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-category\"><div class=\"menu-category-header\"><h3>Drinks</h3><p class=\"md\">From bean to glass, every sip considered</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Doppio</h6></div><p>38 ml</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€2.00</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Filter</h6></div><p>250 ml</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€3.00</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Flat White</h6></div><p>150 ml</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€3.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Caffè Latte</h6></div><p>250 ml</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€3.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Oat Milk</h6></div><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">+€0.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Espresso Tonic</h6></div><p>250 ml</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€3.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Iced Latte</h6></div><p>250 ml</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€3.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Espresso Orange</h6></div><p>160 ml</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€4.50</p></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-category\"><div class=\"menu-category-header\"><h3>Ice Cream</h3><p class=\"md\">Small indulgences to end on a sweet note</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Coffee</h6></div><p>Cream soft serve with coffee sprinkles and espresso</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€2.00</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Olive Oil</h6></div><p>Cream soft serve with olive oil and salt flakes</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€2.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card \"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Matcha</h6></div><p>Cream soft serve with a shot of matcha</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€3.50</p></div><div class=\"menu-grid-card alt\"><div class=\"menu-grid-card-top\"><h6>Cherry</h6></div><p>Cream soft serve with homemade cherry sauce</p><p class=\"menu-grid-card-price\">€3.00</p></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-content\"><div class=\"footer-heading\"><h2>We Look Forward To Your Visit</h2></div><div class=\"footer-button-container\"><a href=\"/reservation\" class=\"slide-button \"><div class=\"slide-button-bg\"></div><span class=\"slide-button-text\"><span class=\"slide-char\"><span class=\"char-default\">P</span><span class=\"char-hover\">P</span></span><span class=\"slide-char\"><span class=\"char-default\">l</span><span class=\"char-hover\">l</span></span><span class=\"slide-char\"><span class=\"char-default\">a</span><span class=\"char-hover\">a</span></span><span class=\"slide-char\"><span class=\"char-default\">n</span><span class=\"char-hover\">n</span></span><span class=\"slide-char\"><span class=\"char-default\"> </span><span class=\"char-hover\"> </span></span><span class=\"slide-char\"><span class=\